{
  "_id": "cGfEQ9zY0BdwOW4y",
  "name": "Sage of Red Faith",
  "type": "effect",
  "img": "modules/titan-vttrpg-compendium/icons/paths/RedFaith_Path_Icon.webp",
  "description": "<p>You have manifested your blood shadow as a copy of yourself made entirely of blood.</p><ul><li><p>Your <strong>Body</strong> and <strong>Soul</strong> increase by <strong>+2</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Your <strong>Stride Speed</strong> increases by <strong>+5</strong>.</p></li><li><p>All <strong>Damage</strong> you inflict increases by <strong>+2</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Your blood shadow appears in a space adjacent to you and has all the same stats and abilities as you. It can move once on your turn. It can take any <strong>Action</strong> you could, but you must use an <strong>Action</strong> to direct it. You may unleash your blood shadow, in which case it no longer requires an <strong>Action</strong> for it to act and it acts on its own accord. This usually means attacking whatever creature is nearest or most vulnerable — including you.</p></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Open Sans',sans-serif\"><strong style=\"font-weight:normal;\" id=\"docs-internal-guid-dcd12564-7fff-bcb5-c45b-7173bd86e5d6\">This effect lasts until the end of combat, you become </strong><strong>Incapacitated</strong>, or you are <strong>Dying</strong>. After you use this ability, you cannot use any ability with the <strong>Apex</strong> trait until you complete a <strong>Long Rest</strong>.</span></p>",
